# campaign-end-w6 -- W6-06-07 / W6-06-08 / W6-06-11 acceptance.
#  * Winning the last Allied mission (ALL12, [Basic] EndOfGame=yes) leaves
#    Continue live on the Campaign Results page [RE: Do_Win FUN_006850b0 --
#    EndOfGame -> the battle's FinalMovie, then the credits, then the menu].
#    This install's MOVIES0x.MIX are stubs, so the movie is skipped and the
#    credits roll straight away; they end on the MAIN menu.
#  * The graph rows are named by side (GUI:Allies / GUI:Soviets), never by
#    the map's INI house ids, and the map's own objects are not "Built".
#  * Esc / Android Back on the Results page = Continue (its default button).
#  * Then ALL01 lost: no First / Second Place panel after a failed mission,
#    and Back = Main Menu (Continue is greyed).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL12s.MAP GDI

until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 60
cheat camp_fire Mission_Victory
until 900 outcome == WON
until 900 scene == result
require scene == result
assert end_of_game == 1                                   @W6-06-07
assert graph_me_name == Allies                            @W6-06-08
assert graph_them_name == Soviets                         @W6-06-08
assert graph_them_built < 10                              @W6-06-08:built
assert graph_me_built < 10                                @W6-06-08:built
shot all12_result
key escape
until 120 scene == credits                                @W6-06-07 @W6-06-11
require scene == credits
assert credits_to_main == 1                               @W6-06-07
wait 30
key escape
until 60 scene == "shell:Main Menu"                       @W6-06-07

# ALL01 lost: no places panel, Back = Main Menu.
click button "Single Player"
click button "New Campaign"
click well:allied
click button Load
until 30 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat kill_house 0
until 900 outcome == LOST
until 300 scene == result
require scene == result
assert places_shown == 0                                  @W6-06-08:places
assert graph_me_name == Allies                            @W6-06-08
shot all01_lost_result
key escape
until 60 scene == "shell:Main Menu"                       @W6-06-11
end
